flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Read number of subjects/]
 B --> C{n > 0?}
 C -- No --> D[Display error]
 C -- Yes --> E[Read and validate marks into list]
 E --> F{All marks valid?}
 F -- No --> G[Display invalid marks]
 F -- Yes --> H[Calculate max, min, total and average]
 H --> I[Count passed subjects]
 I --> J[Display statistics]
 D --> K([End])
 G --> K
 J --> K
